         e.g. "3:12" or "1:04:20" — not a server address, uuid, or key (§5.6). -->
    <string name="home_connected_uptime">Connected for %1$s</string>
    <!-- Shown when the active server decoded fine but StoredProfile.connectable is false
         (fix round 2, Important finding 4) — e.g. VLESS over ws/grpc, which :core:xray
         cannot yet emit a working config for. Deliberately doesn't say "protocol": the
         same message covers both an unsupported protocol and an unsupported transport. -->
    <string name="home_active_server_unsupported">This server isn\'t supported by this build yet — open Servers for details</string>

    <string name="state_disconnected">Disconnected</string>
    <string name="state_disconnecting">Disconnecting…</string>
